WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:01.534
Joe: From Wendy's to Quiznos,

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:03.403
we wanted to find out all the biggest

00:00:03.403 --> 00:00:06.906
portion-size differences
between UK and US fast food.

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:08.575
This is "Food Wars."

00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:15.582
In the UK, Wendy's iconic
Frostys come in three sizes.

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:17.817
Junior, regular, and large.

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:20.420
In the US, we actually
have four Frosty sizes.

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:23.623
Junior, small, medium, large.

00:00:24.891 --> 00:00:26.259
We're going to pour out the largest Frosty

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:28.094
to see how big it is compared to the US's.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:33.199
The classic hamburger at a
Wendy's is called a Dave's,

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:35.168
named after the founder, Dave Thomas.

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:37.971
Ours come in singles,
doubles, and triples.

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:39.172
Our burgers are the same in the UK.

00:00:39.172 --> 00:00:41.574
They also come as singles,
doubles, or triples.

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:44.344
Joe: Now we're going to weigh a US triple.

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:47.814
Pretty close. 14 ounces for our triple.

00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:49.382
Now, while a triple might
be the official limit

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:51.451
on burger sizes at Wendy's,
Wendy's enthusiasts

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:53.787
have come up with something
called a meat cube.

00:00:53.787 --> 00:00:55.088
This is a secret menu item

00:00:55.088 --> 00:00:57.157
where you actually take
an extra meat patty

00:00:57.157 --> 00:00:59.359
and add it to this, so
you get four patties,

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:01.161
which I think adds up to around a pound.

00:01:01.161 --> 00:01:03.797
Joe, I'm officially challenging
you to a meat cube showdown.

00:01:03.797 --> 00:01:06.366
The fastest person to eat
the entire meat cube wins.

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:07.200
You think you got it?

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.102
I accept your challenge, Harry.

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:14.140
Let's do this!

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:17.744
Harry: Three, two, one.
Joe: And start.

00:01:19.379 --> 00:01:20.213
All right.

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:29.823
It's a lot of beef.

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:32.058
I see why the triple is the limit now.

00:01:32.058 --> 00:01:32.992
Time?

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:34.094
Conner: 1:07.

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:35.795
I wish I had more time to chew it.

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:40.033
[coughing]

00:01:42.735 --> 00:01:45.772
Need the sauce. Need some moisture.

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:50.110
The buns!

00:01:52.145 --> 00:01:53.480
Oh, God.

00:01:55.081 --> 00:01:56.216
[Joe yelling]

00:01:57.951 --> 00:01:59.319
How'd I do?

00:01:59.319 --> 00:02:00.153
Done.

00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:04.791
Yeah!

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:05.992
Whoo!

00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:07.360
USA, baby!

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:08.261
Conner: How do you feel?

00:02:08.261 --> 00:02:11.397
Terrible. I feel absolutely terrible.

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:13.733
And yet, elated that I won.

00:02:13.733 --> 00:02:17.036
Well, now we know why the US
has such an obesity problem.

00:02:17.036 --> 00:02:19.572
OK, that's quite enough of that.

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:21.241
Back to our regularly
scheduled programming.

00:02:21.241 --> 00:02:22.075
[beep]

00:02:22.075 --> 00:02:24.144
Another iconic Wendy's
menu item is the Baconator.

00:02:24.144 --> 00:02:26.446
In the UK, these just come
in one size, as a regular.

00:02:26.446 --> 00:02:28.381
Of course, in the US, we
also have the Baconator,

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:30.750
but we have a smaller Baconator,

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:33.153
known as the Son of Baconator.

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:35.054
Something incredibly unsettling

00:02:35.054 --> 00:02:38.024
about a burger having a
child that's also a burger.

00:02:38.024 --> 00:02:41.261
This Baconator giving
birth to that Baconator.

00:02:41.261 --> 00:02:42.529
Harry: And, of course, we're
going to weigh the regular

00:02:42.529 --> 00:02:44.531
Baconators to see whose is bigger.

00:02:44.531 --> 00:02:45.532
The highly regarded

00:02:45.532 --> 00:02:47.767
Wendy's nuggets that
come in regular or spicy.

00:02:47.767 --> 00:02:48.735
Love the spicy.

00:02:48.735 --> 00:02:53.072
They come in units of four, six, and 10.

00:02:53.072 --> 00:02:55.074
Nuggets in the UK only
come in two portion sizes,

00:02:55.074 --> 00:02:56.409
four and eight.

00:02:58.578 --> 00:03:00.547
Wendy's, of course, has fries.

00:03:00.547 --> 00:03:02.849
And those fries in the
US come in four sizes.

00:03:02.849 --> 00:03:05.451
Junior, small, medium, large.

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:07.053
Our fries also come in four sizes.

00:03:07.053 --> 00:03:09.522
Value, small, medium, and large.

00:03:09.522 --> 00:03:11.691
Let's weigh our large fries
to see who's getting more.

00:03:13.326 --> 00:03:14.761
Ours is way less.

00:03:16.596 --> 00:03:19.432
Hm. What's that all about?

00:03:19.432 --> 00:03:20.266
[beep]

00:03:20.266 --> 00:03:22.735
Another side that is
probably unique to Wendy's,

00:03:22.735 --> 00:03:24.971
I can't think of any other
fast-food place that does this,

00:03:24.971 --> 00:03:28.541
is Wendy's chili.
It has been on the menu

00:03:28.541 --> 00:03:31.244
since it opened back in 1969.

00:03:31.244 --> 00:03:33.680
In the US, you can get your chili,

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:35.648
ugh, for whatever reason,

00:03:35.648 --> 00:03:38.151
in two sizes, small and large.

00:03:38.151 --> 00:03:39.819
In the UK, we only have one size of chili,

00:03:39.819 --> 00:03:41.020
which is this one.
We're going to weight it

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:43.856
against the largest size in
the US to find the difference.

00:03:43.856 --> 00:03:45.258
Finally, let's compare drinks.

00:03:45.258 --> 00:03:47.360
In the US, you can get
three sizes of drink.

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:48.995
Small, medium, and large.

00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:51.397
On the internet, it does not specify

00:03:51.397 --> 00:03:54.467
how much fluid ounces are in any of these.

00:03:54.467 --> 00:03:55.768
If I had to guess,

00:03:55.768 --> 00:03:57.503
too much, way too much,

00:03:57.503 --> 00:03:58.338
way, way too much.

00:03:58.338 --> 00:04:00.039
In the UK, drinks come in three sizes.

00:04:00.039 --> 00:04:01.874
Small, medium, or large.

00:04:01.874 --> 00:04:03.042
And these are advertised as being

00:04:03.042 --> 00:04:06.112
12, 16, and 20 ounces, respectively.

00:04:06.112 --> 00:04:07.280
Let's measure the largest drinks

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:08.381
to see which country's is bigger.

00:04:10.116 --> 00:04:11.217
Fizzy.

00:04:12.852 --> 00:04:14.053
So, our large drink actually came out

00:04:14.053 --> 00:04:16.422
as closer to 18 ounces than closer to 20.

00:04:16.422 --> 00:04:18.224
I will say that in the UK,
you fill up your own drink,

00:04:18.224 --> 00:04:19.892
so maybe I just needed to fill a bit more.

00:04:19.892 --> 00:04:21.628
OK, so their large is 18 ounces.

00:04:21.628 --> 00:04:22.495
What is our small?

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:27.500
20 ounces. So our small is
bigger than their large.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:29.636
Man, we love drinking our
calories in this country.

00:04:31.938 --> 00:04:34.741
The fountain drinks at
Popeyes come in three sizes.

00:04:34.741 --> 00:04:36.909
The small, which is 22 ounces,

00:04:36.909 --> 00:04:39.445
the medium, which is 30 ounces,

00:04:39.445 --> 00:04:44.250
and the large, which is,
of course, 40 ounces.

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.085
40 ounces.

00:04:47.287 --> 00:04:48.588
That's so much soda.

00:04:48.588 --> 00:04:50.556
In the UK, drinks only come in two sizes,

00:04:50.556 --> 00:04:52.859
as a kids size or as a regular size.

00:04:52.859 --> 00:04:54.294
We're not sure how much
is in either of these,

00:04:54.294 --> 00:04:55.828
so we're going to measure them both.

00:04:55.828 --> 00:04:57.430
A little over 300.

00:05:02.702 --> 00:05:04.070
About 450.

00:05:08.474 --> 00:05:10.343
But those aren't the biggest, I say!

00:05:10.343 --> 00:05:11.778
Actually, at the Popeyes in the US,

00:05:11.778 --> 00:05:14.514
you can also get a gallon of sweet tea

00:05:14.514 --> 00:05:15.348
[thud]

00:05:15.348 --> 00:05:17.083
and unsweetened tea.

00:05:17.083 --> 00:05:20.019
One. Whole. Gallon.

00:05:20.887 --> 00:05:22.555
[grunts] Look at this.

00:05:22.555 --> 00:05:24.190
Gallon, gallon.

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:25.992
Oh, and don't you hate when dummies

00:05:25.992 --> 00:05:27.327
do that thing where they're like,

00:05:27.327 --> 00:05:30.430
"Hey, the medium is the
same size as the large!"

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:32.332
And it never is, it's,
like, a total con, so.

00:05:32.332 --> 00:05:34.267
Medium soda, large cup.

00:05:38.304 --> 00:05:40.440
Oh, wow, guys!

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:42.141
The medium's about the
same size as the large,

00:05:42.141 --> 00:05:44.410
except for, like, oh, I
don't know, 10 ounces.

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:45.778
Dumb TikTokers, you guys don't even know.

00:05:45.778 --> 00:05:47.980
You're out of your league, TikTokers!

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:50.049
I'm the fast-food king online!

00:05:50.049 --> 00:05:51.184
All right?

00:05:54.454 --> 00:05:56.255
When was this cleaned last?

00:05:59.392 --> 00:06:03.162
Ooh!

00:06:03.162 --> 00:06:05.198
I'm gonna go 36, what do you think?

00:06:05.198 --> 00:06:06.432
I mean, it could have been the amount

00:06:06.432 --> 00:06:07.700
to top of this cup, but again,

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:10.203
you can't fill this to the brim.

00:06:10.203 --> 00:06:11.571
You have to put a cap on it.

00:06:11.571 --> 00:06:13.773
In the UK, fries just
come as a regular serving.

00:06:13.773 --> 00:06:17.310
US, we got two Popeyes fries sizes.

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:18.344
A regular and a large.

00:06:18.344 --> 00:06:20.113
The regular, as we have here,

00:06:20.113 --> 00:06:22.482
just came with a side of
the three-piece we got here.

00:06:22.482 --> 00:06:23.783
And, of course, a large,

00:06:23.783 --> 00:06:27.253
which is a box of just fries.

00:06:27.253 --> 00:06:28.187
Harry: We're going to weigh these to see

00:06:28.187 --> 00:06:29.722
how they compare to the US.

00:06:29.722 --> 00:06:30.957
Joe: We, of course, now, are going to

00:06:30.957 --> 00:06:33.926
also weigh our largest fry.

00:06:34.994 --> 00:06:39.732
Do not sleep on these fries.

00:06:39.732 --> 00:06:41.234
You'll be surprised to learn

00:06:41.234 --> 00:06:44.670
that the inside of this
scale is disgusting.

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:46.773
A Popeyes chicken
sandwich in the UK weighs

00:06:47.707 --> 00:06:50.243
exactly 250 grams.

00:06:50.243 --> 00:06:52.378
Joe: In the US, it weighs

00:06:52.378 --> 00:06:55.948
270 grams.

00:06:55.948 --> 00:06:58.084
In the US, Popeyes signature chicken

00:06:58.084 --> 00:07:00.286
comes in seven serving sizes.

00:07:00.286 --> 00:07:01.220
We'll start with these.

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:03.356
So, of course, the one-piece kids meal.

00:07:03.356 --> 00:07:07.193
Then you can upgrade to
a two-piece regular meal,

00:07:07.193 --> 00:07:09.362
which comes with a side and a biscuit.

00:07:09.362 --> 00:07:11.431
Or you can get yourself the three-piece.

00:07:11.431 --> 00:07:14.734
And a four-piece. Side and a biscuit.

00:07:14.734 --> 00:07:16.469
From there, you can get yourself

00:07:16.469 --> 00:07:18.571
an eight-piece family meal.

00:07:18.571 --> 00:07:21.507
The 12-piece, for the family as well,

00:07:21.507 --> 00:07:23.543
or just for one person over a weekend.

00:07:23.543 --> 00:07:27.013
And the largest, the 16-piece.

00:07:27.013 --> 00:07:29.081
Are you kidding me? [laughs]

00:07:29.081 --> 00:07:30.016
How absurd is this?

00:07:30.016 --> 00:07:32.185
Look at all this chicken!

00:07:32.185 --> 00:07:33.753
In the UK, the signature chicken comes

00:07:33.753 --> 00:07:36.422
as a two-piece meal,
as a three-piece meal,

00:07:36.422 --> 00:07:39.125
or as a six-piece sharer,
as a nine-piece sharer,

00:07:39.125 --> 00:07:41.561
or our largest size, the 12-piece sharer.

00:07:41.561 --> 00:07:43.095
Let's weigh a wing, a thigh, and a leg

00:07:43.095 --> 00:07:44.730
to see whose chickens are bigger.

00:07:45.898 --> 00:07:48.134
So, in the UK, our thigh,
leg, and wing combo

00:07:48.134 --> 00:07:50.269
came to around 290 grams.

00:07:51.471 --> 00:07:54.807
Here we go. First guy up, the leg.

00:07:54.807 --> 00:07:57.643
Next up, got that ♪ wing ♪

00:07:57.643 --> 00:07:58.744
Kind of a wimpy-looking one.

00:07:58.744 --> 00:08:00.746
And this one, the thigh.

00:08:07.253 --> 00:08:08.421
How 'bout the tendies?

00:08:08.421 --> 00:08:10.790
In the US, we have these following sizes.

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:12.558
A kids meal has a one-piece,

00:08:12.558 --> 00:08:15.862
but what's up, they gave us two!

00:08:15.862 --> 00:08:17.396
And then from there,
you get a three-piece,

00:08:17.396 --> 00:08:18.631
which they forgot.

00:08:19.732 --> 00:08:21.767
And then we have five-piece.

00:08:21.767 --> 00:08:22.902
Comes with a side and a biscuit.

00:08:22.902 --> 00:08:24.203
Eight pieces. I feel like

00:08:24.203 --> 00:08:26.272
they're getting bigger as I go along.

00:08:26.272 --> 00:08:27.607
Look at the size of this tender.

00:08:27.607 --> 00:08:30.243
Then we have the 12-piece.

00:08:30.243 --> 00:08:32.879
I mean, guys, this is
like a -- look at this!

00:08:32.879 --> 00:08:34.247
Did you know they're this big?

00:08:34.247 --> 00:08:36.782
This is fantastic.
I love how big these are.

00:08:36.782 --> 00:08:39.018
That's what I'm talking
about, Popeyes! Thank you.

00:08:39.018 --> 00:08:41.654
And, of course, the 16-piece.

00:08:41.654 --> 00:08:42.955
Look at this bad boy.

00:08:42.955 --> 00:08:44.724
Look at the size of these guys.

00:08:44.724 --> 00:08:47.226
Tenders in the UK come
in four portion sizes.

00:08:47.226 --> 00:08:49.161
As a two-piece, which is a kids meal,

00:08:49.161 --> 00:08:51.898
as a three-piece, a five-piece,

00:08:51.898 --> 00:08:53.332
and an eight-piece.

00:08:53.332 --> 00:08:54.767
Next up is the nuggets.

00:08:54.767 --> 00:08:58.104
These can be found in servings
of a four-piece kids meal,

00:08:58.104 --> 00:09:00.840
a six-piece kids meal, eight-piece,

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:02.508
the 12-piece,

00:09:02.508 --> 00:09:04.110
24-piece,

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:05.778
36 pieces.

00:09:05.778 --> 00:09:08.614
And then this double pile right here,

00:09:08.614 --> 00:09:09.782
the biggest order,

00:09:09.782 --> 00:09:11.551
48 pieces.

00:09:11.551 --> 00:09:12.685
And I have to say,

00:09:12.685 --> 00:09:14.387
does not look like enough.

00:09:14.387 --> 00:09:18.357
I know I could destroy that
48-piece with confidence.

00:09:19.191 --> 00:09:20.159
What do we got here?

00:09:20.159 --> 00:09:22.328
Oh, look at this sticker! This is fun!

00:09:22.328 --> 00:09:23.829
Yeah, look at these guys!

00:09:23.829 --> 00:09:25.398
Look at this big one playing a saxophone.

00:09:25.398 --> 00:09:27.099
How fun is that?

00:09:27.099 --> 00:09:28.200
That's cool, right?

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:29.869
In the UK, we actually
call our nuggets bites,

00:09:29.869 --> 00:09:31.337
and they come in the following sizes:

00:09:31.337 --> 00:09:33.072
As a four-piece, which is a kids meal,

00:09:33.072 --> 00:09:35.675
a six-piece, a nine-piece, and a 12-piece.

00:09:35.675 --> 00:09:37.243
Unfortunately, we
couldn't get these today.

00:09:37.243 --> 00:09:39.579
USA. We got biscuits, baby!

00:09:39.579 --> 00:09:41.781
These are the not-cookie biscuits

00:09:41.781 --> 00:09:43.783
that have come up before in
other "Food Wars" episodes.

00:09:43.783 --> 00:09:46.052
These are the biscuits-biscuits.

00:09:46.052 --> 00:09:48.454
And at Popeyes, you can get them in one,

00:09:48.454 --> 00:09:51.023
either on its own or probably
with just about every meal.

00:09:51.023 --> 00:09:53.326
You can also get them in six.

00:09:53.326 --> 00:09:54.894
It's, like, rolling right down here.

00:09:54.894 --> 00:09:57.263
And you can also get them in 12.

00:09:57.263 --> 00:10:00.099
Just overflowing biscuits over here.

00:10:00.099 --> 00:10:02.268
We actually do have biscuits
on the UK Popeyes menu.

00:10:02.268 --> 00:10:04.370
If you order it as a
side, you get one biscuit.

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:09.609
In the UK, Jollibee serves
their famous Chickenjoy

00:10:09.609 --> 00:10:12.044
in six portion sizes, starting with

00:10:12.979 --> 00:10:13.879
a one-piece.

00:10:13.879 --> 00:10:15.414
In the US, you can get your Chickenjoy

00:10:15.414 --> 00:10:17.316
in five different portions.

00:10:18.851 --> 00:10:20.920
A one-piece with a side.

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:22.555
Next up, we've got a two-piece.

00:10:22.555 --> 00:10:24.190
A two-piece,

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:25.691
also with a side.

00:10:25.691 --> 00:10:26.692
We move to a three-piece.

00:10:26.692 --> 00:10:29.261
A three-piece that comes with a side.

00:10:29.261 --> 00:10:30.363
I'm so excited to try this.

00:10:30.363 --> 00:10:32.732
It's my first-ever taste
of Jollibee fried chicken.

00:10:33.766 --> 00:10:35.401
Not my first time, Harry.

00:10:36.335 --> 00:10:38.371
Wow, that's good. That's really good.

00:10:38.371 --> 00:10:40.106
I don't know how it stayed so crispy.

00:10:40.106 --> 00:10:42.108
The next sizes up are buckets of chicken.

00:10:42.108 --> 00:10:44.076
You can get a bucket in six

00:10:46.545 --> 00:10:48.481
or bucket of 10.

00:10:48.481 --> 00:10:50.783
Buckets from a UK Jollibee
come in three sizes,

00:10:50.783 --> 00:10:52.351
starting with a six-piece.

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:57.023
Then, from there, we move
up to an eight-piece bucket.

00:10:59.592 --> 00:11:00.926
And last but by no means least,

00:11:00.926 --> 00:11:03.629
our biggest portion
size is a bucket of 12.

00:11:08.467 --> 00:11:09.568
Should've got a bigger plate.

00:11:09.568 --> 00:11:11.303
I need some more.

00:11:11.303 --> 00:11:12.705
It's really good.

00:11:16.542 --> 00:11:19.578
I just love chicken. And
this is a good example of it.

00:11:27.353 --> 00:11:29.055
These little crispy bits
that fall off your chicken,

00:11:29.055 --> 00:11:30.222
gold dust.

00:11:32.558 --> 00:11:34.293
Let's each weigh our
six-piece buckets to see if

00:11:34.293 --> 00:11:36.462
the Chickenjoy in one country
is bigger than the other.

00:11:36.462 --> 00:11:38.097
It's time for some Jenga.

00:11:40.199 --> 00:11:42.001
Ah!

00:11:42.001 --> 00:11:45.237
We have over 100 grams more chicken!

00:11:45.237 --> 00:11:46.806
[laughs]

00:11:46.806 --> 00:11:48.808
I realize this is so arbitrary.

00:11:48.808 --> 00:11:52.611
The size of the meat,
the amount of coating.

00:11:52.611 --> 00:11:56.515
But it's nice to win, regardless.

00:11:56.515 --> 00:11:57.783
The chicken at Jollibee also comes

00:11:57.783 --> 00:11:59.318
in the form of tenders. In the UK,

00:11:59.318 --> 00:12:01.253
these are served in four portion sizes.

00:12:02.621 --> 00:12:03.723
As a single tender.

00:12:03.723 --> 00:12:06.192
What? One piece? One piece?

00:12:06.192 --> 00:12:08.094
Who's getting one chicken tender?

00:12:08.094 --> 00:12:09.495
As two tenders.

00:12:11.397 --> 00:12:12.898
As a portion of three tenders.

00:12:15.401 --> 00:12:18.137
And, finally, as a portion of four.

00:12:19.972 --> 00:12:22.842
One chicken tender. I've
never heard of that. Anywhere.

00:12:22.842 --> 00:12:24.910
Well, here in America,

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:27.413
we have normal portion sizes
for our chicken tenders.

00:12:27.413 --> 00:12:30.883
You can get them in
three pieces, six pieces.

00:12:30.883 --> 00:12:33.652
I think three is not enough, but OK.

00:12:33.652 --> 00:12:36.455
Three pieces, six pieces,

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:39.492
10 pieces.

00:12:39.492 --> 00:12:40.659
Whoa!

00:12:40.659 --> 00:12:41.794
[sighs]

00:12:44.563 --> 00:12:45.397
[beep]

00:12:45.397 --> 00:12:47.266
Or 16.

00:12:48.167 --> 00:12:49.101
Yeah!

00:12:50.436 --> 00:12:52.371
Tenders. How do you like that?

00:12:53.906 --> 00:12:55.307
Yeah, there's a little
bit more going on now.

00:12:55.307 --> 00:12:57.409
I like it. Little bit of heat to it.

00:12:57.409 --> 00:12:59.011
The batter seems different.

00:12:59.011 --> 00:13:00.846
It has more of the
buttermilk flavor to it,

00:13:00.846 --> 00:13:02.915
of the coating.

00:13:02.915 --> 00:13:03.749
Yeah.

00:13:03.749 --> 00:13:05.651
Garlic mayo. Always.

00:13:05.651 --> 00:13:07.419
Who needs ranch when you have garlic mayo?

00:13:07.419 --> 00:13:09.155
Who needs garlic mayo when you have ranch?

00:13:09.155 --> 00:13:10.623
[boxing bell rings]

00:13:11.991 --> 00:13:14.693
Ranch is far superior to
garlic mayo. No question.

00:13:16.729 --> 00:13:18.964
Hell, yeah. Love ranch.

00:13:18.964 --> 00:13:19.999
A worthy addition.

00:13:19.999 --> 00:13:22.568
Ranch is way better.
You got herbs and spices.

00:13:22.568 --> 00:13:24.370
Aren't they, like,
basically the same thing?

00:13:28.174 --> 00:13:29.742
Then we're on to some
Jollibee specialities.

00:13:29.742 --> 00:13:31.877
Now, one iconic dish is this one.

00:13:31.877 --> 00:13:33.345
This is the Jolly spaghetti.

00:13:33.345 --> 00:13:35.915
Now, this is a dish made of
spaghetti with some cheese

00:13:35.915 --> 00:13:37.917
as well as a sweet-style sauce,

00:13:37.917 --> 00:13:39.585
which is, I think, made
with banana ketchup

00:13:39.585 --> 00:13:40.686
and some meat as well.

00:13:40.686 --> 00:13:42.054
And then it's topped with hot-dog slices.

00:13:42.054 --> 00:13:44.423
In the UK, this only
comes as one portion size.

00:13:44.423 --> 00:13:45.858
That's a cute size you got there, Harry.

00:13:45.858 --> 00:13:47.726
But here in the US, we have three sizes,

00:13:47.726 --> 00:13:49.695
our regular portion,

00:13:49.695 --> 00:13:51.697
our family portion,

00:13:51.697 --> 00:13:53.632
and the party portion.

00:13:53.632 --> 00:13:54.733
Look at this.

00:13:54.733 --> 00:13:56.802
This is supposed to be eight to 10 people.

00:13:56.802 --> 00:13:59.004
It's like a lasagna. Look at that.

00:13:59.004 --> 00:14:00.606
Now, according to a friend
of mine from the Philippines,

00:14:00.606 --> 00:14:02.041
