00:14:02.041 --> 00:14:04.810
into the spaghetti sauce.
So let's give that a try.

00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:08.180
The cold cheese isn't doing it any favors,

00:14:08.180 --> 00:14:09.415
I'll be honest.

00:14:11.317 --> 00:14:12.151
OK.

00:14:12.151 --> 00:14:12.985
Yeah.

00:14:12.985 --> 00:14:13.819
That's actually not bad.

00:14:13.819 --> 00:14:15.387
It's a bit misleading because
their spaghetti is actually,

00:14:15.387 --> 00:14:16.689
the sauce is sweet.

00:14:16.689 --> 00:14:19.191
Very good. Yeah, together,
that's really good.

00:14:19.191 --> 00:14:20.125
Then we're on to the burgers.

00:14:20.125 --> 00:14:22.161
Now, Jollibee is famous
for its Yumburgers,

00:14:22.161 --> 00:14:25.264
which is a beef burger with
its signature burger sauce.

00:14:25.264 --> 00:14:27.733
In the UK, these come as
either a single or as a double.

00:14:27.733 --> 00:14:30.102
Over here in the US, you can
get the classic Yumburger

00:14:30.102 --> 00:14:33.472
or this, the double Yumburger.

00:14:36.775 --> 00:14:38.477
Don't want a bun for your burger, you say?

00:14:38.477 --> 00:14:39.678
Jollibee has you covered.

00:14:39.678 --> 00:14:41.380
They have something
called the burger steaks.

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:44.550
Patties of burgers smothered
in their mushroom gravy.

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:48.254
You can get them in two
patties, three patties,

00:14:48.254 --> 00:14:50.623
or the six-patty family pack.

00:14:50.623 --> 00:14:53.292
Over here, the burger steaks
only come as a two-piece.

00:14:53.292 --> 00:14:56.028
In the US, you can get
a side of white rice.

00:14:56.028 --> 00:14:59.765
We only have one size, and
it's this one right here.

00:14:59.765 --> 00:15:01.533
Same here. Our rice just
comes in one portion,

00:15:01.533 --> 00:15:03.202
and it's wrapped up like this. Very cute.

00:15:06.305 --> 00:15:07.373
Let's start with the starters.

00:15:07.373 --> 00:15:09.008
Now, TGI Fridays in the UK and the US

00:15:09.008 --> 00:15:10.409
both have lots of starter options.

00:15:10.409 --> 00:15:12.144
So what we're going to do is
pick the most popular ones

00:15:12.144 --> 00:15:15.047
and compare those. First up,
we have the mozzarella sticks.

00:15:15.948 --> 00:15:19.618
An order of these in the
UK contains four sticks.

00:15:19.618 --> 00:15:22.187
In the US, our TGI
Fridays mozzarella sticks

00:15:22.187 --> 00:15:25.024
come in an order of six. Six sticks.

00:15:25.024 --> 00:15:26.759
Or you can get the platter,

00:15:26.759 --> 00:15:29.728
which doubles that. 12 sticks.

00:15:29.728 --> 00:15:31.597
Harry: We're going to weigh
three UK mozzarella sticks

00:15:31.597 --> 00:15:33.632
to try and find the average weight.

00:15:33.632 --> 00:15:35.935
Hey, Harry, is that three sticks?

00:15:35.935 --> 00:15:38.971
Thought that order had four?

00:15:38.971 --> 00:15:41.774
So, three mozzarella sticks
in the UK weighed 95 grams.

00:15:41.774 --> 00:15:43.442
That means that each
individual mozzarella stick

00:15:43.442 --> 00:15:45.644
weighed an average of 31.6 grams.

00:15:47.279 --> 00:15:49.081
Joe: Yes.

00:15:49.081 --> 00:15:52.284
So, six sticks is 260 grams.

00:15:52.284 --> 00:15:53.419
So that's roughly

00:15:53.419 --> 00:15:57.356
43-point-repeating-3 grams per stick.

00:15:57.356 --> 00:15:58.624
Now, pro tip.

00:15:58.624 --> 00:16:01.760
Weigh your food, then try one.

00:16:03.429 --> 00:16:04.463
Mm.

00:16:04.463 --> 00:16:07.399
TGI Fridays is running the
mozzarella-cheese-stick game.

00:16:07.399 --> 00:16:10.769
They're running the mozz-stick game.

00:16:10.769 --> 00:16:11.837
Mm.

00:16:11.837 --> 00:16:13.505
The UK does have loaded potato skins,

00:16:13.505 --> 00:16:15.474
